===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|enm|en}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|borjoner|lang=fro}}, {{term|burjoner||lang=fro|to bud", "to sprout}}, from {{term|burjon||lang=fro|a bud}}, of uncertain origin, perhaps from Gmc.

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{intransitive}} To [[grow]] or [[expand]].
#: ''Gradually, the town '''burgeoned''' into a thriving city.''
# {{intransitive}} To [[swell]] to the point of [[burst]]ing.
# {{intransitive|archaic}} Of plants, to [[bloom]], [[bud]].

